  "tip": "<p>When a question emphasizes <i>low latency</i> for users in one region and <i>high availability</i> for Redis, look for multi zone deployment in the same region. Be cautious of options that suggest <i>cross region replication</i> for Memorystore for Redis because it is <i>unsupported</i>.</p>",
